 Any]]:\n357:def parts_for_job(job: str, vin: Optional[str] = None) -> list[dict[str, Any]]:\n374:def all_parts() -> list[dict[str, Any]]:\n392:def search_parts(q: str = \"\") -> list[dict[str, Any]]:","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"c9438151-5a02-4cf6-8e3e-32836c1ceecf","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/c/Users/User/mcp-servers","root":null,"branch":null,"default_branch":null,"status":null,"visibility":null,"error":"pending"},"live_cwd":"/c/Users/User/mcp-servers","platform":"windows"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"95a31ae9-e5ac-4a5b-8e83-a5228836deda","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers","sessionId":"7cb02eb5-e299-4baf-b34b-9eb82aebbf17","version":"2.1.282","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"binary-splashing-comet"}
